"1997","On the authority of Abu Umamah from Amr ibn Abasah al-Sulami, who said: I said to him: ""Narrate to us a hadith that you heard from the Messenger of Allah ﷺ, in which there is no deficiency and no error."" He said: I heard him say:1. ""Whoever has three children born to him in Islam, and they die before reaching the age of puberty, Allah Almighty will admit him to Paradise by His mercy towards them.""2. ""And whoever gets a gray hair in the path of Allah Almighty, it will be a light for him on the Day of Resurrection.""3. ""And whoever shoots an arrow in the path of Allah Almighty, and it reaches the enemy, whether it hits or misses, it will be for him like the reward of freeing a slave.""4. ""And whoever frees a believing slave, Allah will free from the Fire a limb of his for every limb of the slave.""5. ""And whoever spends a pair in the path of Allah Almighty, then Paradise has eight gates, and Allah Almighty will admit him into Paradise from whichever gate He wills."""
